// libjpeg-turbo 3.2.1, the version `with get c.libjpeg-turbo` pins. Every
// citation is a line of the package's installed header, include/turbojpeg.h.
//
// Raw functions (genuinely unmodeled/unsafe by nature):
// - tj3Alloc / tjAlloc / tj3Free / tjFree: raw heap allocator/deallocator
//   (used automatically by `buffer out ... freed by` below).
// - tj3Compress12 / tj3Compress16 / tj3Decompress12 / tj3Decompress16:
//   12/16-bit sample variants taking short*/unsigned short* buffers.
// - tj3CompressFromYUV* / tj3EncodeYUV* / tj3DecompressToYUV* / tj3DecodeYUV*
//   / tjCompressFromYUV* / tjEncodeYUV* / tjDecodeYUV* / tjDecompressToYUV*:
//   planar YUV buffer arrays whose plane counts and alignments depend on subsamp.
// - tj3Transform / tjTransform: multi-output array of allocated buffers with
//   optional DCT-coefficient callback hooks in `tjtransform`.
// - tj3LoadImage* / tj3SaveImage* / tjLoadImage / tjSaveImage: file I/O
//   returning raw heap pixel buffers without byte-length out-parameters.
// - tj3GetScalingFactors / tjGetScalingFactors: returns static array pointer
//   plus out-count (no borrowed slice return in WCL yet).
// - jpeglib.h low-level API: requires caller-managed setjmp/longjmp error_mgr
//   and header pre-includes (<stddef.h>/<stdio.h>).
c facts libjpeg-turbo:
